   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Hi,<div><br></div><div>I would like to calculate Fst for my SNP data. My code is shown below.</div><div><br></div><div><p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t1 &lt;- gl.read.dart(&quot;C:/users/genom/downloads/SNP_data.csv&quot;)</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t2 &lt;-\r\ngl.filter.callrate(t1,threshold = 1)</span><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t2 &lt;- gl.filter.monomorphs(t2)</span><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> out &lt;- gl.fst.pop(t2, nboots=1)</span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> </span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><br></span></span></div><div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(78,154,6);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Starting gl.fst.pop </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"></span></span>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(78,154,6);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">  Processing genlight object with\r\nSNP data</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in ninds[index1, ] : subscript out of bounds</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p></div><div><br></div><div>How to resolve this error?   Thank you in advance.</div><div><br></div><div>Best regards,</div><div>Divya.</div>"
    ]
   ]
