   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\ncan you check your pop definition via <br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\ntable(pop(t2), useNA=&quot;always&quot;)</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" style=\"font-size:11pt\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of Divya SHAJI &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shaji.d...@kyoto-u.ac.jp</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, 7 December 2023 1:53 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> dartR &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">da...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [dartR] gl.fst.pop</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>I would like to calculate Fst for my SNP data. My code is shown below.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t1 &lt;- gl.read.dart(&quot;C:/users/genom/downloads/SNP_data.csv&quot;)</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t2 &lt;- gl.filter.callrate(t1,threshold = 1)</span><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> t2 &lt;- gl.filter.monomorphs(t2)</span><span style=\"color:blue;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;font-size:10pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> out\r\n &lt;- gl.fst.pop(t2, nboots=1)</span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"> </span></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"><br>\r\n</span></span></div>\r\n<div><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\"></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(78,154,6);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">Starting\r\n gl.fst.pop </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"></span></span>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(78,154,6);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\">  Processing genlight object with SNP data</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0in\"></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in ninds[index1, ] : subscript out of bounds</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>How to resolve this error?   Thank you in advance.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Best regards,</div>\r\n<div>Divya.</div>\r\n<p></p></div></div>"
